{"height": 9, "weight": 145, "base_experience": 232, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-attack", "value": 3}], "genus": "Bouquet Pokémon", "capture_rate": 75, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["fairy", "plant"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ロズレイド"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Roserade"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "로즈레이드"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "羅絲雷朵"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Roserade"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Roserade"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Roserade"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Roserade"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ロズレイド"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "罗丝雷朵"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Roserade"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["diamond"], "text": "It attracts prey with a sweet aroma, then downs it with thorny whips hidden in its arms."}, {"versions": ["pearl", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns."}, {"versions": ["platinum", "black", "white"], "text": "Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power."}, {"versions": ["heartgold", "soulsilver"], "text": "Its sweet aroma attracts prey. Then it spews poison. The more toxic it is, the sweeter its aroma."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "After captivating opponents with its sweet scent, it lashes them with its thorny whips."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "The poison in its right hand is quick acting. The poison in its left hand is slow acting. Both are life threatening."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "Hidden within the bouquet on each hand are thorned whips loaded with virulent poison. Roserade moves gracefully as it corners its prey and mercilessly lashes them w